{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L2ZH5AV6fdrGjdEccSPKW3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Aurora Revamp â€” Execution Log\n2\t\n3\tForeman records per-wave build outcomes below. 5 wave(s) planned.\n4\t\n5\t## Waves\n6\t\n7\t### Wave 1 â€” Make the output visible â€” GREEN (2026-06-06)\n8\t\n9\t- **Commit:** 828f3f9 (on branch foreman/aurora-revamp; baseline 148cf10).\n10\t- **Deliverable A (briefing delivery):** new `briefing_delivery.py` â€” auto-surfaced\n11\t  session note (reports/morning/latest_briefing_note.md + `session_note` field in\n12\t  latest_summary.json, read by CLAUDE.md Â§4 at session start) + best-effort Windows\n13\t  toast; both best-effort so delivery never breaks the briefing. Wired into\n14\t  `morning_briefing.main()`.\n15\t- **Deliverable B (index join):** `roles/librarian.py` regenerate_indexes scopes the\n16\t  domainÃ—complexity grid to placeable kinds and points models at their dedicated\n17\t  grid; live `library/index.md` regenerated â†’ 540 placeable rows, 1 unplaced (99.8%\n18\t  â‰¥ 95%), 0 model \"(unplaced) ? (?)\" rows.\n19\t- **Gate:** `python -m pytest` = 690 passed (684 baseline + 6 new). No test weakening.\n20\t- **Review:** 2 independent adversarial reviewers. Closed the verified BLOCKER (stale\n21\t  on-disk index.md regenerated), corrected a factually-wrong code comment, hardened the\n22\t  delivery import. Converged â†’ GO.\n23\t- **Follow-up for John (not committed â€” needs his OK):** a 4-line addition to\n24\t  CLAUDE.md Â§4 telling the session-start agent to surface `session_note`/`top_finds`\n25\t  verbatim. Reverted because editing the agent's own startup config wasn't in the wave's\n26\t  authorization; the data already lands in latest_summary.json which Â§4 reads.\n27\t\n28\t### Wave 2 â€” Security-gate single-owner + backfill â€” GREEN (2026-06-06)\n29\t\n30\t- **Commit:** 5c32bb6.\n31\t- **Single-owner:** servable SQL literal now lives only in `roles/security/gate.py